{"pull": {"id": "number:23333", "number": 23333, "title": "MINOR: Lower log level for non-fatal metadata update failures in AdminMetadataManager", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-09-02T10:05:44Z", "closed_at": "2026-09-02T20:49:32Z", "merged_at": "2026-09-02T20:49:31Z", "user": {"login": "apoorvmittal10", "id": 2861565, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjE1NjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2861565?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10", "html_url": "https://github.com/apoorvmittal10", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "AdminMetadataManager.updateFailed() logged every non-fatal metadata\nupdate failure at INFO. These are transient, retriable errors\n(disconnects, timeouts, etc.) that the admin client recovers from\nautomatically on the next metadata attempt — pending calls trigger the\nretry. Logging them at INFO adds noise on the default logs and causes\nfalse alarms, since a failure that immediately self-heals still prints\n\"Metadata update failed\".\n\nThis changes the log to debug. Fatal errors continue to be logged at\nwarn, but an UnsupportedVersionException was previously logged twice at\nWARN (the generic \"Fatal error during metadata update\" plus the\nBROKER/CONTROLLER-specific message); now only the specific message is\nlogged.\n\nReviewers: Andrew Schofield <aschofield@confluent.io>, Chia-Ping Tsai\n <chia7712@gmail.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 7491388177, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvoWDEQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/clients", "name": "clients", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23333"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_apoorvmittal10_is_pr.json"}